      "created_at": "2012-02-03T05:07:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<blockquote>\n<p>Drawn to the Flame: POWER: Ra deals each non-hero target 1 fire damage for each villain ongoing card in play.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Scorched Earth: Ra deals each non-hero target X fire damage, where X = the number of environment cards in play.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>If Ra uses the Drawn to the Flame power when there are two villain ongoing cards in play, does Ra do one attack to each non-hero target for two fire damage each or does Ra do two attacks to each non-hero target for one fire damage each?</p>",
